From 9cc74ce7794809d123729237cae836cc3a573758 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChenghaoLiu <linkmecry@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:07:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] [LoongArch] Add signal and context handling

Implement ntdll signal/context layer for loongarch64:
- unix/signal_loongarch64.c: syscall dispatcher, exception/APC/callback
  dispatchers, segv/trap/usr1/usr2 handlers, context save/restore
- signal_loongarch64.c: PE side entry points and __chkstk/setjmp helpers
- dwarf.h: DWARF register mapping (GPR 0-31, FPR 32-63)
- relay.c: fix stack argument byte count (shift by 3)
- unwind.c: temporary RtlVirtualUnwind stubs until .pdata support
- setjmp.h, exception.h: loongarch64 jump buffer layout
- PE directory lookups: loongarch64-windows / loongarch64-unix
